{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "a552050bfe6d12c400f81404dd238101337585cd0a59ab959e0eca92552724e3", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nよかった、待ってたんですよ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n太好了，我等你好久啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "59f5f1c5161a84274d27dc4d141c64640e0557717b4e4b15ee85877065c5f568", "ja": "青羽さん。\n何かあったんですか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，\n有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "942e388ec0708aa0899c3de3d4094437e29e581c943c4a70eb770899575d0146", "ja": "はい！　社長さんが、{$P$}さんに\nお話したいことがあるから、事務所に来て欲しいって。", "zh": "是的！社长说有事想和{$P$}先生谈，\n希望你能去事务所一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a6401a5e49637064219f4bd69f035880c1ef2094d163deb8bef044795953d500", "ja": "社長が……？\nわかりました、今から行ってきます！", "zh": "社长他……？\n明白了，我现在就过去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "af89d9e3627f60c674a9893053913c87e3a52c712c6440841651be73871fe2d1", "ja": "よろしくお願いしますね！\nいってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "就麻烦你了喔！\n路上小心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1005_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3e5691b89478ea9c8bb04333f27729cd785fbf777b90db5bdb0e9b7fe891a2ff", "ja": "失礼します。\n社長、お話というのは……。", "zh": "打扰了，\n社长，请问有什么事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "74a063a113f172a235aa88c00dc6cb9bea08e562254a745b2679c3297cfb3593", "ja": "お久しぶりです、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，好久不见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4f2c0830306f66ca2edf9abad84e4f7542088a71ca8c75b80625b0a93ae1d338", "ja": "あっ。あなたは……！", "zh": "啊，你是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "beb178df1165e336a9568e87d867772ae0fb98f5de8a78b49391d755455f7f86", "ja": "はい、765プロ事務所の、影のマスコット！\n勤続●●年の名事務員、音無小鳥です♪", "zh": "是的，我就是765艺能事务所的隐藏版吉祥物！\n年资●●年的知名事务员──音无小鸟♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "afd1b970a24cae62050d04dd303130b1b49544e30671547a70fb1c3fff3e4eef", "ja": "音無さん、お久しぶりですね！\n俺は最近、すっかり劇場詰めだから……。", "zh": "音无小姐，好久不见了呢！\n因为我最近都一直关在剧场里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "23d61ae8e31b02b24dd71ceca25ae7d7a839b0286ceafdc13d840fbf84fbac99", "ja": "私は、こちらの事務所通いですからね。\nすれ違っちゃってましたけど。", "zh": "而我是在这边的事务所上班嘛，\n之前一直没机会见到面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "bbb7ca776af9fdfe121e96703f29c32e34352a6e2ade34049e1d41ae167cd89e", "ja": "でも、お元気そうで何よりです！\nすごいご活躍だって、美咲ちゃんからも聞いてますよ♪", "zh": "但你看起来很有精神，真是再好不过了！\n我也有听美咲说你十分活跃喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c6ef14b9123fea790add544aa63e1dc17cef20c14550372a5380e4b25ee5b82e", "ja": "とんでもない。劇場は、まだまだこれからです。\nところで、社長は……？", "zh": "你过奖了，剧场还有很多需要努力的地方。\n话说回来，社长呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "4249299b4152156ebdde854d6b6f8995832b0859bce3ce3fa483d9ba13133c19", "ja": "私はここにいるよ！　いやぁ、よく来てくれたね。\n急に呼び出したりして、すまなかった。", "zh": "我在这里喔！哎呀，麻烦你跑这一趟了。\n突然把你叫过来，真是抱歉啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "6207814758aa2e2d993daeccfc35b31c3767a07c8531862959a8615203ed9f66", "ja": "まぁ、楽にして聞いてくれたまえ。\n今日、君を呼んだのは他でもない。", "zh": "好了，你放轻松听我说，\n今天叫你过来不为别的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "7a1498b4c192e8e2155893b9652d48375ddb432c8ca5f89ec9c7e247ac388d19", "ja": "劇場の運営も、軌道に乗って来た頃合いだろう？\nそこでだ……。", "zh": "最近剧场的营运也差不多上轨道了吧？\n所以说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "2b32e57eae379bb07df1f4c57faeee6e26740b48fca45382786689e67c9c03b0", "ja": "ここでひとつ、新たなアイドルユニットを\n結成したいと考えているのだよ！", "zh": "现在我打算来组一个\n新的偶像团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cd8de81eef121658b067eb140737648b01754272f69320ef394d9ef8f56f74e9", "ja": "新しいアイドルユニット……ですか？", "zh": "新的偶像团体……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "27333c13764ff2fe56da0109e5b568a663d48363231db050ff766899fa2e5af3", "ja": "うむ。まず第一弾として、最上静香君、北沢志保君、\n箱崎星梨花君、そして野々原茜君、北上麗花君……。", "zh": "没错，首先第一团就由最上静香、北泽志保、\n箱崎星梨花，以及野野原茜、北上丽花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "67a60cc0a036c8d7b6eec664de168a343ababcfc83f4bec18b4e9d682e55fe4a", "ja": "この5人からなる新たなアイドルユニット。\nその名も『クレシェンドブルー』だ！", "zh": "这五位来组成偶像团体，\n团名便是『Crescendo Blue』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "98691113f9ce662ff1dc17d0c1920ce5dec57b6d63f9ece8aad43338157bf878", "ja": "クレシェンドブルー……！", "zh": "Crescendo Blue……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "c4893bc51e612d2fd098e1518886b3625ef7832b46e032d385498f186ba504e5", "ja": "今朝、青い空を見上げていてひらめいたそうです。\nステキな名前ですよね♪", "zh": "似乎是社长今早仰望蓝天时灵光一闪想到的，\n这名字十分动听吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "cdf5c8d7847414eb404f8efb0ab885b2ac62ba67da210b7164bc09737dbc7739", "ja": "ふふふふ、そうだろう？\nやはり、早起きは三文の得だよ、君！", "zh": "呵呵呵呵，没错吧？\n果然早起的鸟儿才有虫吃啊，你说是吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "5978e8858f7a29fd254a899ec7116f61c2eca9e067fafe437ced7ff6c8942036", "ja": "な、なるほど。参考にします！", "zh": "原、原来如此，我会参考的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "b46dcc69dc29add7703120e9b994fcb13e276cbeca5242d38cb508ad31903985", "ja": "社長は、このクレシェンドブルーを\n目玉にした公演を考えてるそうですよ！", "zh": "社长似乎正在规划由「Crescendo Blue」\n为演出重点的公演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "078af6eace4a205b84ea9f5696cfb25ee7d74c21c3eba37363b973a49012ee40", "ja": "もちろん彼女達のプロデュースも、君に任せるつもり\nなんだが……どうだろう。引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "我当然打算把她们的培育工作\n交给你做……怎么样，你愿意接受吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_1027", "source_sha256": "9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3", "ja": "もちろんです！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "92cd3bbf5393784861ad9eb09603c21db7d3fe88b3d01ed19ec707636e14ca42", "ja": "もちろんです！　クレシェンドブルーの公演、\n必ず成功させてみせます！", "zh": "那当然！我一定会让「Crescendo Blue」\n的公演成功的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "154b101b9c931bb6b9b849a0cf2b676b924240a575d6bb1954d3d36f7b6125a2", "ja": "うむ、いい返事だ！\nそれじゃあ、よろしく頼んだよ！", "zh": "嗯，很棒的回答！\n那就交给你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "67b91397f3a98f083a20cdc9d65b7eece0c6b0010ff659980d31ea87e0bcc786", "ja": "頑張ってくださいね、{$P$}さん！\n私も、事務所で頑張ります♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请你加油喔！\n我也会在事务所努力工作的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "60767ae1bac30298ec53aa9a52b0b07262aec76f176b215a2c638c813c4afbbb", "ja": "（クレシェンドブルーか……。\n選ばれたメンバーも、ずいぶん個性的だな）", "zh": "（Crescendo Blue吗……\n社长选出的成员都很有个性呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "456085dcae260da3cd31033301f267f1d83860992aeb2d38cf68098d5235a152", "ja": "（これは、プロデュースのしがいがありそうだ！）", "zh": "（听起来很有培育的价值！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
